{"id":"bebdae22f1a7cb82","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-WKL0-propositional-compactness.md","title":"WKL0 Is Equivalent to Countable Propositional Completeness and Compactness","display":"thm-WKL0-propositional-compactness — WKL0 Is Equivalent to Countable Propositional Completeness and Compactness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-WKL0-propositional-compactness","aliases":["62-thm-WKL0-propositional-compactness"],"display":"thm-WKL0-propositional-compactness — WKL0 Is Equivalent to Countable Propositional Completeness and Compactness","depends_on":["[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-WKL0]]","[[62-df-logic-principles]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","[[62-thm-WKL0-first-order-completeness]]","[[62-lem-RCA0-tree-propositional]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem IV.3.3 (1, 5 and 6)","source_pages":[140,141],"source_pdf_pages":[158,159]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-WKL0-propositional-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-WKL0-propositional-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-WKL0-propositional-compactness — WKL0 Is Equivalent to Countable Propositional Completeness and Compactness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4410266791957a4\" href=\"?note=c4410266791957a4\" title=\"62-df-logic-principles\">62-df-logic-principles</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7b7b0f262c7cb40\" href=\"?note=c7b7b0f262c7cb40\" title=\"62-thm-WKL0-first-order-completeness\">62-thm-WKL0-first-order-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"662111b1b5e3b00d\" href=\"?note=662111b1b5e3b00d\" title=\"62-lem-RCA0-tree-propositional\">62-lem-RCA0-tree-propositional</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem IV.3.3 (1, 5 and 6)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>140</span><span>141</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>158</span><span>159</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a>，PCT、PComp 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c4410266791957a4\" href=\"?note=c4410266791957a4\" title=\"62-df-logic-principles\">62-df-logic-principles</a>，理论等价见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>；一阶完备性和树命题编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c7b7b0f262c7cb40\" href=\"?note=c7b7b0f262c7cb40\" title=\"62-thm-WKL0-first-order-completeness\">62-thm-WKL0-first-order-completeness</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"662111b1b5e3b00d\" href=\"?note=662111b1b5e3b00d\" title=\"62-lem-RCA0-tree-propositional\">62-lem-RCA0-tree-propositional</a>。</p>\n<p>上述理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\\)</span>，参与比较的上游原则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PCT},\\mathrm{PComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{PCT},\\mathrm{PComp}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}WKL0\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\{\\mathrm{PCT}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\{\\mathrm{PComp}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}WKL0\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\{\\mathrm{PCT}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\{\\mathrm{PComp}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>WKL₀ 的 GCT 应用于零元关系语言给 PCT。RCA₀ 中 PCons 与 PFinSat 等价：有限真值表可靠性排除相容 Γ 的不可满足有限子集；有限真值表完备性把不可满足子集变成矛盾证明；相反，两条矛盾证明的有限前提不可能可满足。因此 PCT 与 PComp 互推。PComp 的模型应用于 Γₜ，得到原树路径。</p>\n<p>有限真值表论证在有限公式码和有限赋值上进行，不调用无穷命题紧致性证明它自身。该节点保留 IV.3.3 的完整两种命题逻辑版本，未把“每个有限命题集可判定”误作“可数相容命题集有一个总赋值”。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Theorem IV.3.3 (1, 5 and 6)；纸面页 140, 141；PDF 页 158, 159。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-WKL0","status":"resolved","id":"87afe420a89e1fce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-WKL0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-logic-prin